  "_readme": [
    "Player-name pronunciation overrides for the neural commentary voices (edit freely; the worker reloads this file automatically).",
    "Forms: \"Name\": \"respelling\"  (English commentary only)",
    "       \"Name\": {\"say\": \"respelling\", \"ipa\": \"IPA\", \"langs\": [\"en\", \"fr\"]}",
    "       \"Name\": {\"en\": {\"say\": \"...\"}, \"fr\": {\"say\": \"...\"}}",
    "Respellings are read by the English phonemiser, so spell it like an English word (Zoob, Ool-mark).",
    "\"ipa\" is used where the engine accepts phonemes (Kokoro); otherwise \"say\" is used.",
    "Names are matched case-sensitively as whole words; a trailing 's is kept.",
    "Words with accented letters (ö ä å ü č š ž ř é ...) that are NOT listed here get a simple English letter fallback in English commentary."
